# THE SDIST SHIPS THE TRACKED TREE, so its own suite runs from the artifact.
# setuptools' default carries `tests/test*.py` and nothing those tests import or
# open, so 0.1.3's suite stopped at collection: five errors, nothing ran.
#
# Named path by path rather than grafted from the root, because a working tree
# is not the repository: an untracked `.hygiene-local.json` exists to hold names
# that must never be published, and a root graft would ship it.
graft .githooks
graft .github
graft battery
graft docs
graft evidence
graft examples
graft tests
graft tools
include .gitignore CHANGELOG.md FINDINGS.md SECURITY.md
prune battery/corpus
exclude battery/battery_result.json .hygiene-local.json
global-exclude *.py[cod]
